  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Information materials on drugs used in Sweden to prevent young people from using drugs will be adapted to Russian conditions and translated into Russian. 1000 boxes will be produced including a separate training programme for teachers, social workers and the police who handle these problems in St Petersburg.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Informationsmaterial om droger, som anv&#xE4;nds i Sverige f&#xF6;r att undvika unga m&#xE4;nniskors missbruk av narkotika, skall anpassas till ryska f&#xF6;rh&#xE5;llanden och &#xF6;vers&#xE4;ttas till ryska. 1000 &quot;Narkotikal&#xE5;dor&quot; kommer att produceras och &#xE4;ven ett separat program f&#xF6;r l&#xE4;rare, socialarbetareoch polis som hanterar dessa problem i St Petersburg.</narrative>
  </description>
